#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:5
#: 9b8916bc2aa945ea9b57605dff48d7a8
msgid "Team accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:7
#: 8f9e7fcf608d4d7b96c9de5031e45255
msgid "Users can switch to a Team account to invite collaborators, share projects and manage team balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:9
#: 3ce55f0d2d594419b32ac402c88c8684
msgid "Once the Team is created, the creator (Team Admin) can invite new members and assign their balance. The Team profile is accessible to all Team members, but only the Team Admin can manage it (assign balance, update, or delete the Team)."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:12
#: a6c9717ceab14007be7afd63dd55d7fe
msgid "We highly encourage you to switch to the Team account if you are looking forward to working with other coworkers and managing multiple projects. Feel free to contact our support, so we can assist you in setting up a Team workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:16
#: 936165d5fa104d28a63f2f10235ca6ec
msgid "Create a new Team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:18
#: 33d397071a3144bb9766c9d94d4e1546
msgid "To create a new Team enter the name and start inviting new members by their email."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 48cd820bdca049909a1923dd47a17859
#: b64e827d03be43ae8d6e9cd5897cb182
msgid "create a team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:28
#: 5b7333d61f48434483f9ebf6e1918e70
msgid "Inviting new team members"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:30
#: 13fc36a821c34ec4af4d191315c7e096
msgid "Switch to the tab **Invitations**. Enter user email associated with his Mapflow account. If user is not registered at Mapflow, he will get an invitation by email and will be able to join the Team following the registration."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Invite users to team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:41
#: 87165ee91400495c8dbbf798fe89fd4e
msgid "As a Team admin, you will see all the invitations sent and may revoke them. As a Team member, you will see only your invitations to the Team."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:45
#: fc7d9f63a0ae4e84bcb142be58b278d3
msgid "Managing Team balance"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:47
#: bc237bdf0bce4122b443f99a67ebeb0b
msgid "As soon as one creates a Team, his credit balance becomes the Team balance and is available for assignment to Team members, including the Team Admin himself. This means the Admin has to distribute the team balance among all members, including himself."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:60
#: 5a36fb1e8a064de48032f48cdd5a7d4a
msgid "1. Team balance 2. Personal balance 3. Team member's Balance (remaining)"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:61
#: f9e88ff99c7d4ad7a38b6dc5372eb6f5
msgid "The Admin directly controls each member's **Balance** - the remaining amount available for the member to spend."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:63
#: 41d9da7b719e4ac08e500d2e315f474b
msgid "When assigning balance, keep in mind that when a team is created, its balance is entirely allocated to the Owner's balance. Therefore, you must first reduce the Owner's balance to free up \"Unallocated credits\" before you can assign balance to other team members. See below for how this works in practice:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: e6edc7bbd9c140bd859189e54e6b5d59
msgid "team balance"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:73
#: 074052e21cdb4f9ba58f5141fd09742c
msgid "If your Team account is switched to area-based billing, the only difference is that the balance is assigned in sq. km."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:77
#: b27eafa0991d4b278b522754b802b385
msgid "Project sharing in the Team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:79
#: f1f8dc515cd14695834a9b6f310501c3
msgid "You can share your project with anyone in the Team and assign his role as needed. Go to the `Projects <https://app.mapflow.ai/en/projects>`_. Click on a dot menu icon in a project card -- Share."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 552a99022642454596b16478ae66f4a6
#: e6edc7bbd9c140bd859189e54e6b5d59
msgid "Share project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:89
#: dfde578fcf4e4e5bad617a0c11da6689
msgid "Select your coworkers or toggle \"Anyone in the team\" if you want to share with all of them."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:97
#: d50631b8f0214fdbad1523587850793d
msgid "There are four types of the project user's role that can be assigned to your coworkers:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:99
#: 7652b357a4ea46e2ba9f489ff05ecf41
msgid "**readonly** - can view the project history and the results"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:100
#: 6c2f27acf5994eabab7f252b2c5383b4
msgid "**contributor** – can run the workflows in the project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:101
#: db4550eb101d442181a134cfb09fdb2d
msgid "**maintainer** – can run and edit the workflows, and share projects with users (up to maintainer role)"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:102
#: 8bc4c707799943ef9154949a6d2180d6
msgid "**owner** – full rights to edit all roles in the project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:104
#: e3eca4be191f4cc9ad8ce9f97fbda77a
msgid "Your collaborators will see the new shared projects in their dashboard and use them according to the role assigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:107
#: cc230419b45c4efd856f7c53202db87f
msgid "You can also share your project with any users outside your team for the view-only access. Go to the Project -- Share and enter the existing Mapflow user's email. If the new user is not registered at Mapflow.ai, invite him to register first."
msgstr ""
